	<key>readme</key>
	<string>meme [query]   Grid of all memes. Type to filter by title, keywords or notes.
  ↩   copy the meme (file + image data, pastes in Slack, Mail, browsers, …)
  ⌘↩  reveal in Finder
  ⌥↩  copy the file path
  ⌃↩  edit its details
  ⇧ / ⌘Y  Quick Look preview

memes [query]  Manage the collection: add the Finder selection, annotate memes without details, edit or remove (⌘↩) a meme.

Add images from Finder with the "Add to Memes" Universal Action, or set a hotkey on the Hotkey trigger. A short guide asks for title, keywords, notes and source.

Details live in index.yaml inside the meme folder.
</string>
